Bounded←{                               ⍝ trust-region interior point
    ⍺←⊢ ⋄ l u ∆←3↑⍵⍵,⎕CT
    (l∧.≤⌈/⍬)∧u∧.≥⌊/⍬:⍺ ⍺⍺ ⍵ ⋄ ⎕DIV←1   ⍝ unbounded for infinite bounds
    c h g←¯3↑⍺ ⍺⍺ p←(l+∆)⌈(u-∆)⌊⍵       ⍝ clamp parameters to interior
    v←((g<0)×u-p)+(g>0)×p-l             ⍝ coleman-li distance
    h+←(v*-÷2)×⍤¯1∘.=⍨⍳≢p               ⍝ add interior-point penalty
    p c h g
}
